OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian dies after being struck
OL,4,Aby car on M8 near Glasgow Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pedestrian has died after being
OL,7,Fstruck by a car on the M8 motorway just
OL,8,Fwest of Glasgow Airport.
OL,10,FPolice Scotland said the 45-year-old
OL,11,Fman was hit by a black Mini Cooper,
OL,12,Fclose to junction 29, at about 23:45 on
OL,13,FSunday.
OL,15,FThe busy motorway was closed in both
OL,16,Fdirections overnight between junctions
OL,17,F29 and 30 but reopened shortly before
OL,18,F09:00 on Monday.
OL,20,FThe closure caused long tailbacks
OL,21,Fduring the morning rush hour with
OL,22,Fdiversion routes becoming congested.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
